OL,4,BRaya set to have scan on injury - how  
OL,5,Bmuch would Arsenal miss him?           
OL,6,GInjuries are never good news, but      
OL,7,GArsenal's latest one to first-choice   
OL,8,Ggoalkeeper David Raya has come in the  
OL,9,Gworst possible position.               
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old was forced to leave    
OL,12,Fthe pitch 70 minutes into Saturday's 2-
OL,13,F2 draw with Newcastle, appearing to    
OL,14,Fhurt his shoulder in an innocuous      
OL,15,Fchallenge with Magpies forward William 
OL,16,FOsula.                                 
